Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you, Comsek. Good afternoon to our honorable guests and resource person and to the department of human settlements development headed by secretary Jose Ramon Ping Aliling today we deliberate the budget of the dishud agencies and

asr-000043
00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:59.980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: corporations bilang pangunahing mayakda ng DSUD act malinaw po sa atin ang mandato ng department ito'y tiakin na mas maraming Pilipino magkakaroon ng abot kaya at desenteng tahanan but given our limited fiscal space we have to make sure that every peso allocated for housing addresses the most urgent needs and produces measurable results. As we deliver it the budget of the DSOD, we shall zoom in on three main concerns. Number one, epek

asr-000044
00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:29.980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Epektibo pa rin ba ang kasalukuyang housing programs? Naayon pa rin ba ang mga plano at proyekto matapos ang sunod-sunod na bagyo, pagbaha, lindo, landslide at iba pang mga sakuna. Pangalawa, makatuwiran ba talaga ang mga pabahay at financing programs para sa ordinaryong Pilipino kasama na ang middle income families? Paano natin mapapagaan ang kanilang buwan ng renta o amortization lalo na sa panahon na kung kailan patuloy ang pagtaas ng presyo ng

asr-000045
00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:59.980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: iba't ibang mga babayarin lalo na ang pangunahing mga bilihin? Huli, sapat at maayos ba ang gamit ng pondo upang mapaliit at tuluyang wakasan ang ating housing bakl. When we address our country's housing needs, we do not only ask how many units were completed or produced. We also ask if these houses were built not only to uphold the Filipino's economic growth but his or her dignity. More than houses, we want to build homes, homes that can house

asr-000046
00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:29.980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: their dreams. As we we go along, we recognize the vital role of this in gearing towards this direction. Let us address the existing and potential challenges, secure proper funding and discuss the necessary steps to strengthen the foundation of our housing sector. Thank you very much. We just wait for other senators to come and probably to to raise their concerns

asr-000047
00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:45.630
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: later. So I now call on secretary Jose Ramon Aliling to deliver his opening statement and to present the 2027 proposed expenditure program of the department of human settlements and urban development and attach attach agencies and corporations. You may how have the floor

asr-000047-split-2
00:21:45.630 --> 00:21:59.980
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: to the chairman of the finance committee and the father of the HSUD Senator JV. Magandang hapon po. Unang-una, ah kami'y nagpapasalamat sa sa inyong mga guidance sa sa pagdating po sa

asr-000048
00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:29.980
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: programa ng pabahay. Ang ating ah pambansang pabahay para sa Pilipino program. Tulad po ng sabi niyo kanina, tinitingnan po natin kung siya pa ay una angkop sa kasalukuyang sitwasyon ng ating mga kababayan at ang ang ating mga intended na beneficiaries. Nakita po natin itong unang taon, unang taon ng pambansang pabahay para sa Pilipino program, hindi po gaganon

asr-000049
00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:59.980
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: kaganda ang naging traction sa ground. Makikita po ito sa datus. Makikita po ito sa mga nakinabang. initially sa pambansang pabahay para sa Pilipino program. So ang ginawa po natin na improvement dito ay in-expand natin yung 4PH dahil nakikita po natin ang housing program nagiging demand driven. Ibig sabihin, kung ano yung kaya nung ating mga kababayan na walang bahay o walang tahanan, yung dapat na matapatan natin

asr-000050
00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:30.000
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: ng angkop na programa ng pabahay. Yung unang taon po ng 4ph, isang modalidad lang o modality ang kasama sa 4ph. Ito ay ang vertical housing modality. Ito po ay in-expand natin. Bakit? Number one, alam po natin may mga lugar na hindi po angkop ang vertical housing lalong-lalo na sa mga probinsya.

asr-000051
00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:38.460
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Pangalawa, mas mahal po ang condominium unit kumpara sa row houses o horizontal modality.

asr-000052
00:23:40.940 --> 00:23:47.620
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Lalo pa nating tinignan na kahit na meron po tayong vertical at horizontal modalities,

asr-000053
00:23:48.100 --> 00:23:54.780
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: meron pa rin po tayong kababayan na hindi kaya o hindi nila ma-afford pa itong horizontal housing

asr-000054
00:23:54.780 --> 00:24:03.400
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: dahil makikita po natin kung magkano mamaya, ipapakita po natin magkano ba yung amortization range ng vertical at horizontal housing.

asr-000055
00:24:03.840 --> 00:24:10.900
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So, dinagdagan pa rin po natin. Meron na po tayong vertical, horizontal, dinagdag po natin yung rental housing modality.

asr-000056
00:24:11.680 --> 00:24:17.400
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Kasi kahit gusto po natin minsan bumili ng isang bagay kung hindi natin kaya, tayo po ay walang choice.

asr-000057
00:24:18.120 --> 00:24:23.720
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Kung hindi mag-renta muna habang tayo'y ini-improve natin ang ating kabuhayan o darating araw

asr-000058
00:24:23.720 --> 00:24:31.040
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: na yung isang membro ng pamilya ay makakatulong na sa paghulog ng ating minimiting tahanan.

asr-000059
00:24:32.620 --> 00:24:37.960
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Kung hindi pa rin po kaya ang rental modality o hindi available dun sa area nila,

asr-000060
00:24:38.820 --> 00:24:43.300
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: dinagdag din po natin sa 4PH ang Community Mortgage Program.

asr-000061
00:24:44.120 --> 00:24:50.260
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ito po ay mag-a-address dun sa mga informal settler families na mababa ang sahod

asr-000062
00:24:50.260 --> 00:24:53.340
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: o hindi pa nila kayang maka-afford ng rental housing.

asr-000063
00:24:53.720 --> 00:24:58.380
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: At lalo na yung pinakamahal na modality ng 4PH na vertical housing.

asr-000064
00:24:59.360 --> 00:25:09.720
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So dito po, dahil po dito, ang resulta po nito, marami pong nag-qualify o naisaman na doon sa programa ng 4PH.

asr-000065
00:25:11.440 --> 00:25:16.960
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So nung una, isang libo ang take out ng vertical modality.

asr-000066
00:25:17.520 --> 00:25:18.520
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ngayon po,

asr-000067
00:25:20.040 --> 00:25:22.960
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: ang nag-qualify,

asr-000068
00:25:23.720 --> 00:25:26.080
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: ang nag-qualify na po sa 4PH

asr-000069
00:25:26.080 --> 00:25:29.640
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: is around 135,000.

asr-000070
00:25:29.720 --> 00:25:34.640
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Hindi po ibig sabihin nito, gumawa tayo ng 135,000 na housing unit sa isang taon.

asr-000071
00:25:35.040 --> 00:25:38.540
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ang ibig pong sabihin nito, dahil in-expand natin yung 4PH,

asr-000072
00:25:39.180 --> 00:25:43.680
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: for example, sa horizontal housing, yung mga inventaryo ng ating mga developers

asr-000073
00:25:43.680 --> 00:25:49.580
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: na dati hindi qualified sa 4PH, naisama natin sa 4PH.

asr-000074
00:25:49.580 --> 00:25:53.280
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ang ibig sabihin nito, panag-avail yung mga buyers ng horizontal housing,

asr-000075
00:25:53.720 --> 00:25:59.120
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: makakakuha po sila ng subsidy, interest subsidy.

asr-000076
00:25:59.460 --> 00:26:02.060
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Therefore, magiging beneficiary sila ng 4PH.

asr-000077
00:26:02.920 --> 00:26:04.700
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ganon din po yung rental housing.

asr-000078
00:26:05.640 --> 00:26:10.360
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Yung mga LGU po at government agency na may lupa,

asr-000079
00:26:11.140 --> 00:26:15.780
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: na merong intended beneficiaries na ang priority natin yung mga nasa danger areas,

asr-000080
00:26:16.640 --> 00:26:23.200
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: ito po, itinatayo natin ngayon sa mga lupa ng LGU at government agency.

asr-000081
00:26:23.720 --> 00:26:29.020
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ang modality ng ito, ang magpapatakbo nito ay yung LGU at the day.

asr-000082
00:26:29.580 --> 00:26:32.720
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ang pinatern po natin ito sa Disciplina Village.

asr-000083
00:26:32.940 --> 00:26:39.140
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So, rinireplicate po natin yung success ng mga Disciplina Village sa iba't ibang lugar sa ating bansa.

asr-000084
00:26:40.240 --> 00:26:42.560
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Huli, itong community mortgage program.

asr-000085
00:26:43.360 --> 00:26:45.840
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Under po ito sa Social Housing Finance Corporation,

asr-000086
00:26:46.800 --> 00:26:49.080
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: nakita po natin ang gano'ng ka-efektibo ito,

asr-000087
00:26:49.080 --> 00:26:53.360
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: dahil ito po, nagli-range lang ng around 600,

asr-000088
00:26:53.720 --> 00:26:56.360
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: 400 to 600 pesos per month ang amortization

asr-000089
00:26:56.360 --> 00:26:59.840
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: ng informal setter families na mag-a-avail nito.

asr-000090
00:27:00.680 --> 00:27:04.740
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So, dito po, kaya tumaas ang numero ng 4PH.

asr-000091
00:27:04.900 --> 00:27:10.220
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Hindi dahil nakagawa tayo ng bahay o housing units na isang taon na 135,000.

asr-000092
00:27:10.360 --> 00:27:16.140
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Dahil in-expand natin ito at mas marami tayong natulungan na ating mga kababayan,

asr-000093
00:27:16.140 --> 00:27:20.840
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: kung ano yung kaya nila sa affordable para sa kanila,

asr-000094
00:27:21.000 --> 00:27:23.600
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: meron po tayong katapat na housing program.

asr-000095
00:27:23.720 --> 00:27:26.100
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ito po yung expanded 4PH.

asr-000096
00:27:26.960 --> 00:27:29.200
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Pagdating naman po sa mga disaster,

asr-000097
00:27:30.520 --> 00:27:33.720
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: meron naman po tayong in-introduce, kasama rin po ng 4PH,

asr-000098
00:27:34.320 --> 00:27:38.100
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: yung transitory o temporary housing natin using modular shelter units.

asr-000099
00:27:38.700 --> 00:27:41.140
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ito po yung tinatawag natin mga bayanihan villages.

asr-000100
00:27:42.100 --> 00:27:44.960
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So, makikita po natin itong mga nakaraang buwan o nakaraang taon,

asr-000101
00:27:45.080 --> 00:27:49.600
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: meron po tayong mga naitayo mga bayanihan villages sa mga LGU properties

asr-000102
00:27:49.600 --> 00:27:53.700
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: na nasa lantan ng bagyo na apektohan ng lindol sa kaiba pang mga kalamildad.

asr-000103
00:27:53.720 --> 00:27:56.560
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So, ito na po ang 4PH ngayon.

asr-000104
00:27:56.980 --> 00:28:00.560
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Tumaas ang numero, hindi dahil nakagawa tayo ng bahay na gano'ng karami

asr-000105
00:28:00.560 --> 00:28:02.480
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: o housing units na gano'ng karami isang taon,

asr-000106
00:28:02.580 --> 00:28:05.380
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: kundi in-expand natin mas maraming modality ngayon

asr-000107
00:28:05.380 --> 00:28:08.420
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: ang pwedeng mag-enroll o makinabang sa 4PH

asr-000108
00:28:08.420 --> 00:28:13.780
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: at dun sa interest subsidy na ating kasama sa yearly budget.

asr-000109
00:28:14.980 --> 00:28:16.480
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Pagdating naman po sa regulatory,

asr-000110
00:28:17.320 --> 00:28:20.000
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: inayos po natin yung issuance ng mga license to sell.

asr-000111
00:28:20.520 --> 00:28:23.680
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Sa ngayon po, pag tinignan po ninyo yung average number,

asr-000112
00:28:23.720 --> 00:28:26.680
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: license to sell na na-issue in terms of number of units.

asr-000113
00:28:27.220 --> 00:28:32.420
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ngayon, 2026 po ang forecast natin using the average per month

asr-000114
00:28:32.420 --> 00:28:35.200
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: and the denial rate of only 7%.

asr-000115
00:28:35.200 --> 00:28:42.060
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ang ibig sabihin, sa 10 bahay na in terms of number of units po

asr-000116
00:28:42.060 --> 00:28:45.460
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: ang monitoring natin, less than 1% lang ang nade-deny.

asr-000117
00:28:46.200 --> 00:28:49.660
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: And then, hinikpatin din natin yung 15-day review period po.

asr-000118
00:28:51.860 --> 00:28:53.700
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Lahat ng regulatory application,

asr-000119
00:28:53.720 --> 00:28:55.880
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: meron lang tayong 15 days to review.

asr-000120
00:28:56.580 --> 00:29:01.980
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So, we are now on our 15th week na zero overdue po

asr-000121
00:29:01.980 --> 00:29:03.740
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: ang application ng license to sell.

asr-000122
00:29:05.180 --> 00:29:07.900
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Pagdating naman po sa mga reklamo ng mga homebuyers

asr-000123
00:29:07.900 --> 00:29:10.340
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: at sa homeowner's association,

asr-000124
00:29:10.900 --> 00:29:12.860
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: tuloy-tuloy po ang pag-reconcile natin

asr-000125
00:29:12.860 --> 00:29:15.960
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: pag-conduct natin ng mga conciliation meetings

asr-000126
00:29:15.960 --> 00:29:17.500
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: sa lahat ng regional offices.

asr-000127
00:29:18.460 --> 00:29:20.120
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So, ito po, makikita natin,

asr-000128
00:29:20.120 --> 00:29:23.060
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: hindi lang po nagkoconcentrate ang DSUD ngayon

asr-000129
00:29:23.060 --> 00:29:26.720
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: sa ating pambansang pabahay para sa Pilipino-Piripino program.

asr-000130
00:29:27.160 --> 00:29:29.200
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Kung hindi pati yung regulatory functions po

asr-000131
00:29:29.200 --> 00:29:31.660
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: na malinaw naman po sa mandato ng DHSUD,

asr-000132
00:29:32.140 --> 00:29:33.780
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: na yun ang trabaho ng DHSUD,

asr-000133
00:29:33.940 --> 00:29:36.920
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: balansihin ang interest ng mga developer

asr-000134
00:29:36.920 --> 00:29:38.200
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: at ng mga homebuyers,

asr-000135
00:29:38.320 --> 00:29:40.780
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: kasama na rin yung mga homeowner's associations.

asr-000136
00:29:41.740 --> 00:29:45.380
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So, Mr. Chairman, ito na po ang DHSUD ngayon.

asr-000137
00:29:46.300 --> 00:29:49.140
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: With your permission, we will now start our presentation.

asr-000138
00:29:51.920 --> 00:29:52.980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yes, please proceed.

asr-000139
00:29:53.060 --> 00:29:55.100
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: Good afternoon, Mr. Chair.

asr-000140
00:29:55.360 --> 00:29:59.740
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: We have the team of DHSUD and KSA today to...

asr-000141
00:29:59.740 --> 00:30:06.380
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: make our presentation and should there be need, the team is always available to answer many of

asr-000142
00:30:06.380 --> 00:30:12.340
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: these questions. So let me start with the Department of Human Settlements and Urban

asr-000143
00:30:12.340 --> 00:30:20.260
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: and its attached agencies. Next slide. So this is the outline of our presentation today.

asr-000144
00:30:20.500 --> 00:30:26.700
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: We'll discuss about our agency and our attached agencies. We'll cover the highlights and major

asr-000145
00:30:26.700 --> 00:30:35.680
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: trust for the fiscal year 2027, our accomplishments against the targets in 2025, our performance at

asr-000146
00:30:35.680 --> 00:30:43.860
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: a glance, our budget utilization rate for our PAPs, and our other additional requests. So if I may

asr-000147
00:30:43.860 --> 00:30:50.020
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: start, the DSUD is actually the primary national government entity responsible for the management

asr-000148
00:30:50.020 --> 00:30:56.680
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: of housing, human settlements, and urban development. Under DSUD, we have three main

asr-000149
00:30:56.680 --> 00:31:02.140
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: categories of players. Our production arm is actually the National Housing Authority.

asr-000150
00:31:02.140 --> 00:31:10.000
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: Our financing arm covers the Social Housing Finance Corporation, Pag-ibig or Home Development

asr-000151
00:31:10.000 --> 00:31:16.780
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: Mutual Fund, and the National Home Mortgage Finance Corporation. And we are joined by

asr-000152
00:31:16.780 --> 00:31:25.700
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: the Human Settlements Adjudication Commission as our adjudication arm. For the period 2027,

asr-000153
00:31:25.700 --> 00:31:26.660
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: the agencies proposed the following

asr-000154
00:31:26.660 --> 00:31:28.000
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: a total of about

asr-000155
00:31:28.440 --> 00:31:38.040
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: 6 billion. Next slide, please. 6 billion was allocated to us in this year's GAA.

asr-000156
00:31:38.380 --> 00:31:49.300
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: And 5.498 billion was allocated for next year's National Expenditure Program,

asr-000157
00:31:49.300 --> 00:31:55.020
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: or a variance of about 579 million less compared to this year.

asr-000158
00:31:55.020 --> 00:32:04.260
DHSUD Senior Undersecretary Henry L. Yap: Vis-a-vis its proposal, we actually proposed altogether 60 billion but the variance is about 54 billion.

asr-000159
00:32:05.080 --> 00:32:10.260
