Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Okay, thank you. At this point, Senator Bongo, I would like to make a manifestation and probably ask some questions.

asr-002201
01:30:14.820 --> 01:30:30.860
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Salamat, Mr. Chairman, Senator J.B. Hercito. At siya po yung principal sponsor nitong inyong departamento noong 17th Congress.

asr-002202
01:30:30.860 --> 01:30:41.700
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Dahil po yan sa kanya at napirmahan rin po ni former President Duterte na meron ng sariling departamento para sa housing.

asr-002203
01:30:42.540 --> 01:30:44.760
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: I would like to manifest my support.

asr-002204
01:30:44.820 --> 01:30:48.600
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: For the budget of the Department of Human Settlements and Urban Development.

asr-002205
01:30:49.760 --> 01:30:58.600
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Salamat po sa inyong servisyo. Headed by Secretary Jose Ramon Aliling sa lahat ng mga USECs. Narito, USEC Robles, USEC IAP.

asr-002206
01:30:58.600 --> 01:31:14.600
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: And of course, itong touch agencies ninyo, ang NHA, headed by GM Joe Bentay, sa Pag-ibig, Social Housing Finance Corporation, National House of...

asr-002207
01:31:14.820 --> 01:31:22.000
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: National Home Mortgage Finance Corporation, Human Settlements Education Commission.

asr-002208
01:31:22.800 --> 01:31:30.900
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sa inyong lahat, Commissioner IAP, Commissioner Tolentino, CEO Marlene Acosta.

asr-002209
01:31:31.400 --> 01:31:34.040
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Klamihan po sa inyo yung nakatrabaho ko na rin po lahat noon.

asr-002210
01:31:35.340 --> 01:31:40.340
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: PCEO Federico Laxa ng Social Housing. Salamat sa inyong servisyo.

asr-002211
01:31:40.340 --> 01:31:42.400
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: USEC Marisol Anenas.

asr-002212
01:31:42.860 --> 01:31:44.060
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sa isahin ko na lang po lahat.

asr-002213
01:31:44.820 --> 01:31:52.880
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Toto Tobias, Amado Ablao, Director Benji Lett, Suniga, Director Vizpo.

asr-002214
01:31:53.020 --> 01:31:57.040
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Salamat sa inyo, sa lahat po na empleyado ng Dishud.

asr-002215
01:31:58.200 --> 01:32:00.500
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Full support po ako sa inyo always.

asr-002216
01:32:00.780 --> 01:32:07.700
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ang ehensyang ito ay mahalagang tungkulin at yakin na ang bawat pamilyang Pilipino ay may disenting tirahan.

asr-002217
01:32:07.700 --> 01:32:12.700
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At yung pinangarap natin na sana na walang...

asr-002218
01:32:13.260 --> 01:32:13.700
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Wala dapat...

asr-002219
01:32:14.820 --> 01:32:19.400
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Walang dapat na squatter sa sarili nating bayan.

asr-002220
01:32:20.000 --> 01:32:28.200
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kaya bawat pisong inilaan natin para sa pabahay ay dapat direktang mapakinabangan ng mga pamilyang higit na nangangailangan.

asr-002221
01:32:28.360 --> 01:32:30.760
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Lalong-lalo na po yung mga mahirap nating kababayan.

asr-002222
01:32:31.460 --> 01:32:40.280
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: The proposed 2027 NEP allocates a total budget of 5.499 billion for the Dishud.

asr-002223
01:32:40.280 --> 01:32:44.780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: This is 9.5 lower than the 2026 total program budget.

asr-002224
01:32:44.820 --> 01:32:48.940
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Of 6.079 billion.

asr-002225
01:32:49.740 --> 01:32:58.480
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: While the proposed budget is reduced, the need for decent and affordable housing has not diminished.

asr-002226
01:32:59.020 --> 01:33:05.100
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: In fact, with the rising cost of land and construction materials at sa taas po ng presyo ng bilihin,

asr-002227
01:33:05.280 --> 01:33:10.000
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: lalong nagiging mahirap para sa ordinaryong Pilipino na magkaroon ng sariling tahanan.

asr-002228
01:33:10.000 --> 01:33:14.500
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sa kakaikot ko po sa buong bansa, nakikita kong kalagayan ng ating mga kababayan.

asr-002229
01:33:14.820 --> 01:33:22.560
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sunog, baha, lindol, putok ng bulkan, mga sakuna. Maraming sa ating mga kababayan po ang nangangailangan ng tulong sa pabahay.

asr-002230
01:33:23.120 --> 01:33:27.840
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sana po ay mas paigtingin pa ng Dishud ang kanilang mga programang magbibigay tulong sa kanila.

asr-002231
01:33:28.400 --> 01:33:31.540
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Lalo na yung mga walang matakbuhan kundi po ang gobyerno.

asr-002232
01:33:32.380 --> 01:33:35.920
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Meron lang po akong katanungan about the housing backlog.

asr-002233
01:33:36.880 --> 01:33:41.940
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mr. Chair, the magnitude of our country's housing problem remains a serious concern.

asr-002234
01:33:41.940 --> 01:33:43.940
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: For years, government estimates placed a...

asr-002235
01:33:44.820 --> 01:33:49.400
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: the country's housing need at around 6.5 million units.

asr-002236
01:33:50.100 --> 01:33:59.440
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: With the earlier projections warning that housing requirements could reach as high as 22 million units by 2040

asr-002237
01:33:59.440 --> 01:34:03.100
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: if left not addressed.

asr-002238
01:34:03.980 --> 01:34:08.620
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kung hindi po ito ma-address, it could reach as high as 22 million units

asr-002239
01:34:08.620 --> 01:34:11.840
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: ang housing requirements na backlog.

asr-002240
01:34:12.200 --> 01:34:14.640
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Dishud has recently stated that the actual...

asr-002241
01:34:14.820 --> 01:34:19.720
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: the housing backlog is approximately 2.2 million units.

asr-002242
01:34:22.620 --> 01:34:25.520
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sino pong sasagot nito? Dishud, no? Sekretary Aliling.

asr-002243
01:34:27.020 --> 01:34:31.740
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Mr. Chair, based on the latest PSA study,

asr-002244
01:34:32.500 --> 01:34:38.920
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: ang forecast natin sa housing need by 2028 is 3.7 million units.

asr-002245
01:34:39.280 --> 01:34:41.260
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Broken down as follows.

asr-002246
01:34:41.260 --> 01:34:44.160
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Number one, 1.1 million.

asr-002247
01:34:44.820 --> 01:34:49.460
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ito po yung may mga sariling tahanan, unit kailangan i-rehabilitate or ayusin.

asr-002248
01:34:50.100 --> 01:34:55.080
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So most likely, nandyan po sa 1.1 million na yan, yung mga informal settler families.

asr-002249
01:34:55.580 --> 01:35:00.620
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ang solution po na nakikita natin dyan under the 4PH is the community mortgage program.

asr-002250
01:35:01.380 --> 01:35:04.500
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Para pag na-award po sa kanila yung kanilang mga tinitirhan,

asr-002251
01:35:05.160 --> 01:35:09.980
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: mas mainganyo silang magpaayos, magpa-repair ng mga tahanan nila.

asr-002252
01:35:09.980 --> 01:35:14.200
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Then the second is the 2.2 million na tinatawag natin double up.

asr-002253
01:35:14.820 --> 01:35:19.720
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ito pong double up, ito po yung may multiple families living under one roof.

asr-002254
01:35:20.860 --> 01:35:29.020
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So ito po, buong span po ito, hindi lang ito socialized housing, pati open market kasama rito.

asr-002255
01:35:29.540 --> 01:35:38.640
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So kahit na may kaya yung pamilya, basta more than one family ang nakatira, kasama po sila dito sa 2.2.

asr-002256
01:35:38.640 --> 01:35:44.660
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Then the 400,000 remaining of the 3.7 million is yung forecast nung neto,

asr-002257
01:35:44.660 --> 01:35:47.280
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: na masisira at maayos.

asr-002258
01:35:47.500 --> 01:35:51.540
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So yung po yung 3.7 million, ang gusto lang po natin yung highlight dito,

asr-002259
01:35:52.120 --> 01:35:58.840
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: na yung 4PH po, pag na-expand natin ito, napalago natin, naparami natin yung output nito,

asr-002260
01:35:59.020 --> 01:36:06.400
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: should ultimately help resolve the projected housing need of 3.7 million by 2028.

asr-002261
01:36:07.380 --> 01:36:12.500
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Salamat. Pwede natin pasingitin muna natin ang Mr. Trabajador ng Senado.

asr-002262
01:36:12.700 --> 01:36:14.500
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kasi hindi lang po kami...

asr-002263
01:36:14.660 --> 01:36:20.300
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Trabajador dito, lagari rin po kami, konektado po itong housing. Lagari yung trabaho.

asr-002264
01:36:21.060 --> 01:36:26.100
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I'd like to ask our Majority Leader for his questions, Ms. Consul.

asr-002265
01:36:26.380 --> 01:36:27.400
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Quick last question.

asr-002266
01:36:28.080 --> 01:36:32.900
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Chairman, pleasant good afternoon, Secretary, to the members of the housing agencies.

asr-002267
01:36:33.200 --> 01:36:38.280
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Salamat, Senator Bong, kasi lagari ako, I have to go back as Majority Floor Leader in the floor.

asr-002268
01:36:38.420 --> 01:36:41.260
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: There's still discussions being taken up on the bills on the floor.

asr-002269
01:36:42.120 --> 01:36:44.620
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Ano lang po, Mr. Chairman, just a quick...

asr-002270
01:36:44.660 --> 01:36:51.260
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: update because I had been able to do institutional amendments on two projects in Bukidnon

asr-002271
01:36:51.260 --> 01:36:55.140
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: worth 250 million in last year's budget.

asr-002272
01:36:56.080 --> 01:37:01.340
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: And, of course, relocation sites po ito, resettlement sites.

asr-002273
01:37:01.920 --> 01:37:05.560
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: So, ang balita daw ay nag-upisan na yata yung construction.

asr-002274
01:37:05.820 --> 01:37:10.340
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Secretary, nandito si Mr. Joben, who I coordinate naman all the time.

asr-002275
01:37:10.560 --> 01:37:13.380
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: I think na-stall yata yung implementation.

asr-002276
01:37:14.660 --> 01:37:22.340
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: So, what I did is I went to the DBM and the DBM wrote us a letter.

asr-002277
01:37:22.580 --> 01:37:31.840
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: And the letter basically states that na-release po nila yung SARO dated June 30, 2026.

asr-002278
01:37:32.740 --> 01:37:34.680
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: So, may SARO na po yung dalawang projects.

asr-002279
01:37:36.140 --> 01:37:39.000
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Ang sabi, ang pondo daw ay nasa NHA.

asr-002280
01:37:39.000 --> 01:37:43.740
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: But when we talk to the NHA, sabi po ng NHA ay wala pa po yung pondo.

asr-002281
01:37:44.660 --> 01:37:48.220
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Sure, because I want to do this again next year, General, GM.

asr-002282
01:37:48.740 --> 01:37:54.820
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: I want to be able to do institutional amendments to be able to put more resettlement sites in Bukidnon.

asr-002283
01:37:54.920 --> 01:37:57.280
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: But I want to make sure that we will not hit a snag.

asr-002284
01:37:57.820 --> 01:38:00.720
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: I don't know where the snag is actually.

asr-002285
01:38:01.320 --> 01:38:06.680
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: May we ask maybe the GM to let us know kamusta na po yung status ng...

asr-002286
01:38:06.680 --> 01:38:13.180
NHA General Manager Joeben A. Tai: Actually, Mr. Chair, we're coordinating with the DBM for them to hopefully download the funds.

asr-002287
01:38:14.660 --> 01:38:22.220
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Yes, pero ang sabi ng DBM, at kahusap po si Secretary himself, si Secretary Kim,

asr-002288
01:38:23.720 --> 01:38:29.760
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: is nag-download po daw silang pera sa NHA.

asr-002289
01:38:30.580 --> 01:38:32.200
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: So, is that system that way?

asr-002290
01:38:32.260 --> 01:38:36.020
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: They'll download and then you guys decide where to put the funds?

asr-002291
01:38:36.420 --> 01:38:42.320
NHA General Manager Joeben A. Tai: Actually, the downloaded funds was for a different project, Mr. Chair.

asr-002292
01:38:43.340 --> 01:38:44.020
NHA General Manager Joeben A. Tai: So...

asr-002293
01:38:44.660 --> 01:38:49.140
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: How do you resolve this kaya, Chairman?

asr-002294
01:38:49.320 --> 01:38:54.240
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Kasi, siyempre, kung tatanayin mo yung may SARO na, Mr. Chair,

asr-002295
01:38:55.500 --> 01:39:00.500
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: ang sabi nila, nandiyan na daw yung SARO, tapos may pondo pa daw yung NHA.

asr-002296
01:39:01.100 --> 01:39:08.000
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Siyempre, yung NHA, gagamitin nila yung pondo nila doon ng ibang programa hanggang lumabas yung notice of cash allotment.

asr-002297
01:39:08.080 --> 01:39:10.660
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Ang gulo naman ang gobyerno natin, Mr. President.

asr-002298
01:39:10.880 --> 01:39:13.880
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Ganon ba yung, Mr. Chairman? Ganon ba yung sistema nun?

asr-002299
01:39:14.660 --> 01:39:22.300
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Can we make representation to the DBM and ask if they can give the notice of cash allotment?

asr-002300
01:39:22.300 --> 01:39:24.640
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Mr. Chair, I think DBM representative is...

asr-002301
01:39:24.640 --> 01:39:26.440
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Mr. Chair, if I may add...

asr-002302
01:39:26.440 --> 01:39:27.480
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: She or he?

asr-002303
01:39:28.580 --> 01:39:31.240
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: May we ask the DBM representative?

asr-002304
01:39:31.520 --> 01:39:33.120
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Tama, tama. Nandito pala yung DBM.

asr-002305
01:39:33.320 --> 01:39:34.820
NHA General Manager Joeben A. Tai: Mr. Chair, if I may add...

asr-002306
01:39:34.820 --> 01:39:35.800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yes, sir.

asr-002307
01:39:36.220 --> 01:39:37.140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: The challenge actually is...

asr-002308
01:39:37.140 --> 01:39:38.980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ano nga yung kanina, dilema mo rin?

asr-002309
01:39:38.980 --> 01:39:42.420
NHA General Manager Joeben A. Tai: Yeah, because puro SARO po, wala pong cash.

asr-002310
01:39:42.780 --> 01:39:43.980
NHA General Manager Joeben A. Tai: And parang...

asr-002311
01:39:44.660 --> 01:39:48.340
NHA General Manager Joeben A. Tai: It's very attractive by DBM to use cash from the others.

asr-002312
01:39:48.520 --> 01:39:53.660
NHA General Manager Joeben A. Tai: My challenge is, Mr. Chair, mas malaki po yung gaako compared sa NIP.

asr-002313
01:39:54.640 --> 01:40:00.940
NHA General Manager Joeben A. Tai: So, yung cash ko mas maliit compared sa institutional commitments that I get.

asr-002314
01:40:01.640 --> 01:40:07.200
NHA General Manager Joeben A. Tai: So, I cannot fill it up if my NIP is smaller than the gaako.

asr-002315
01:40:08.700 --> 01:40:11.580
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: May we ask the DBM?

asr-002316
01:40:11.580 --> 01:40:13.560
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Madam Director Lulu?

asr-002317
01:40:14.660 --> 01:40:16.320
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Ano pong status po nito?

asr-002318
01:40:16.460 --> 01:40:23.340
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Kasi halos kalahati, 50% na yata yung trabaho sa maramag bukid nun po ito,

asr-002319
01:40:23.420 --> 01:40:25.700
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: tsaka keson bukid nun.

asr-002320
01:40:26.320 --> 01:40:28.260
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Yung mga tao, excited na excited na po.

asr-002321
01:40:28.720 --> 01:40:34.000
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Pero, ano yan, yung mga banat sa social media ay parang ghost project na naman po.

asr-002322
01:40:34.160 --> 01:40:38.260
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Kaya sabi namin, we want to make sure that these are properly implemented

asr-002323
01:40:38.260 --> 01:40:43.720
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: or else, apektado na naman tayo sa social media yung buong bansa,

asr-002324
01:40:43.860 --> 01:40:44.380
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: administration.

asr-002325
01:40:44.660 --> 01:40:47.080
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: So, Director, what is the status of that?

asr-002326
01:40:47.340 --> 01:40:50.060
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: Yes, good afternoon, Mr. Chair, and Your Honor.

asr-002327
01:40:51.080 --> 01:40:56.540
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: Although narilis po namin ang SARO, which pwede na po sila mag-obligate,

asr-002328
01:40:56.920 --> 01:41:03.280
DBM Assistant Director Lulu P. Vispo: yung NCA po kasi, based on the statement of cash flows as of June 30, 2026,

asr-002329
