Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you, ma'am.

asr-002470
01:52:19.560 --> 01:52:21.100
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Hindi na ako magdatalong sa inyo.

asr-002471
01:52:21.620 --> 01:52:22.760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We'll just forward it to you.

asr-002472
01:52:23.700 --> 01:52:29.000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Dito na lang sa, ano, KSEC na lang siguro, just to hopefully wrap up in a few, ano,

asr-002473
01:52:29.460 --> 01:52:31.520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: hopefully will be done by, before 6.

asr-002474
01:52:32.880 --> 01:52:38.740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: 200 families in Slipo, Tondo, Manila will be affected by LRT Line 2 extension.

asr-002475
01:52:39.140 --> 01:52:41.740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: May nakahanda na ba tayong housing projects para sa kanila?

asr-002476
01:52:42.540 --> 01:52:44.160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Nag-coordinate ba tayo sa DOC?

asr-002477
01:52:44.360 --> 01:52:44.960
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: OTR dito?

asr-002478
01:52:45.140 --> 01:52:45.960
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Is it NHA?

asr-002479
01:52:46.380 --> 01:52:48.960
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Di ba meron dapat fund ang DOTR for the relocation?

asr-002480
01:52:50.120 --> 01:52:51.120
NHA General Manager Joeben A. Tai: Yes, Mr. Chair.

asr-002481
01:52:51.220 --> 01:52:58.400
NHA General Manager Joeben A. Tai: But unfortunately, yung ibang project po ng DOTR was not continued already, Mr. Chair.

asr-002482
01:53:00.080 --> 01:53:05.640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: In December last year, your department and DepDEP issued a joint circular updating the price ceiling

asr-002483
01:53:05.640 --> 01:53:09.080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: for socialized subdivision and condominium projects.

asr-002484
01:53:09.200 --> 01:53:13.760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: May we know if you have already considered the oil price hike in this new price ceiling?

asr-002485
01:53:13.760 --> 01:53:20.160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, KSEC, meron na ba tayong, ano, did you consider itong oil price hike sa bago nating ceiling?

asr-002486
01:53:21.560 --> 01:53:33.880
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Yeah, we already requested for this and there's a TWG between DSUD and DepDEP for the proposed increase of the price housing, price ceiling.

asr-002487
01:53:35.600 --> 01:53:38.060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Okay, ito naman, some concerns, no?

asr-002488
01:53:38.060 --> 01:53:42.360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I think we discussed about this already, Secretary.

asr-002489
01:53:42.760 --> 01:53:43.060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pero I just...

asr-002490
01:53:43.760 --> 01:53:45.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Just for the record, para din malaman ng iba.

asr-002491
01:53:46.640 --> 01:53:53.420
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Last April, we conducted the subcommittee hearing on Memorandum Circular No. 2025-014

asr-002492
01:53:53.420 --> 01:53:58.940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: where we discussed the department's procedural change from the regional offices to the central office.

asr-002493
01:53:59.880 --> 01:54:05.440
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We have received complaints from developers that the centralized system poses multiple challenges

asr-002494
01:54:05.440 --> 01:54:09.760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and potential backlogs, especially for projects from far-off areas.

asr-002495
01:54:10.480 --> 01:54:13.440
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Beyond the housing sector, prolonged processing may also affect construction.

asr-002496
01:54:13.760 --> 01:54:21.760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Job creation, investor confidence, and the willingness of developers to invest in new housing projects.

asr-002497
01:54:21.880 --> 01:54:30.340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, can we just get an update or a report on its implementation, particularly on the remaining backlogs at the regional level,

asr-002498
01:54:30.420 --> 01:54:33.580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: pending regulatory applications and average processing time?

asr-002499
01:54:33.640 --> 01:54:37.120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I understand na nag-decentralize na kayo ulit, no?

asr-002500
01:54:37.120 --> 01:54:42.760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, can we just get the remaining backlogs, yung mga ano, some information?

asr-002501
01:54:42.760 --> 01:54:45.460
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And pending regulatory applications?

asr-002502
01:54:46.060 --> 01:54:50.240
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Regarding the, Mr. Chairman, regarding the regulatory applications,

asr-002503
01:54:50.900 --> 01:54:55.580
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: as I mentioned in my opening statement, for 15 consecutive weeks,

asr-002504
01:54:56.260 --> 01:55:04.200
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: this would, certified by all the regional directors, has no overdue pending regulatory application.

asr-002505
01:55:05.160 --> 01:55:09.600
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Then, for the decentralization, this is really part of the program.

asr-002506
01:55:09.600 --> 01:55:12.540
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: When we centralized it, we were just fixing.

asr-002507
01:55:12.760 --> 01:55:13.480
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Our guidelines.

asr-002508
01:55:13.660 --> 01:55:16.100
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Kasi iba-iba ang nangyayari previously.

asr-002509
01:55:17.160 --> 01:55:21.000
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Nangyayari previously, alam naman natin, hindi naman sikreto yan sa industriya,

asr-002510
01:55:21.360 --> 01:55:26.040
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: license to sell for sale, which we do not want to happen.

asr-002511
01:55:26.160 --> 01:55:30.580
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Kasi at the end of the day, pag na-issue, ano nang maling license to sell yung mga developer?

asr-002512
01:55:30.820 --> 01:55:33.580
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Pag nag-complain yung mga buyer, talo yung buyer.

asr-002513
01:55:33.580 --> 01:55:40.860
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: For example, pinangako sa kanila may swimming pool yung amenities, pero yung dokumento naman, wala.

asr-002514
01:55:41.180 --> 01:55:42.460
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So, natatalo po yung buyer.

asr-002515
01:55:42.760 --> 01:55:46.480
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: We had to do this, although everybody had to sacrifice.

asr-002516
01:55:46.720 --> 01:55:51.880
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: We acknowledge the comments made by the stakeholders, particularly the developers.

asr-002517
01:55:52.740 --> 01:55:55.200
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Pero this process, tapos na po ito.

asr-002518
01:55:55.440 --> 01:55:58.740
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: As I mentioned, nakikita naman na we already decentralized.

asr-002519
01:55:59.040 --> 01:56:03.900
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Now, oversight function will still remain as oversight function.

asr-002520
01:56:03.900 --> 01:56:09.380
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ano ba ang oversight function ng central office ngayon over these regional offices?

asr-002521
01:56:09.560 --> 01:56:10.780
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Dalawang bagay lang po yan.

asr-002522
01:56:11.400 --> 01:56:11.900
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Number one, siguradong...

asr-002523
01:56:12.760 --> 01:56:16.900
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: na within 15 days, ma-action na yan yung mga regulatory applications.

asr-002524
01:56:17.800 --> 01:56:22.740
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Tatlo lang po ang aksyon na gagawin ng regional office dyan within 15 days.

asr-002525
01:56:22.860 --> 01:56:24.120
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Number one, they can approve.

asr-002526
01:56:24.300 --> 01:56:25.720
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Number two, they can deny.

asr-002527
01:56:26.220 --> 01:56:28.920
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Number three, they can issue a notice of deficiency.

asr-002528
01:56:29.540 --> 01:56:35.840
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Now, ang second function po ng oversight function ng central is to make sure na yung actions nila

asr-002529
01:56:35.840 --> 01:56:39.100
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: ay angkop or naayon sa ating mga guidelines.

asr-002530
01:56:40.160 --> 01:56:41.920
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So, ito lang po ang naging...

asr-002531
01:56:42.760 --> 01:56:43.480
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: ...proseso natin.

asr-002532
01:56:43.600 --> 01:56:48.960
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Now, by October po, papasok na po ang digitalization ng regulatory natin.

asr-002533
01:56:49.140 --> 01:56:51.780
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ibig sabihin ito, you can apply online.

asr-002534
01:56:52.080 --> 01:56:55.020
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Hindi na physically dadalhin yung mga applications.

asr-002535
01:56:55.020 --> 01:56:57.140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, yung mga taga-provinsya, hindi na kailangan munta dito.

asr-002536
01:56:57.280 --> 01:56:58.780
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: They can apply online.

asr-002537
01:56:58.880 --> 01:56:59.140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Online.

asr-002538
01:56:59.880 --> 01:57:07.660
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So, towards the end of the year po, makikita na natin itong transition naman from manual to digitalization.

asr-002539
01:57:08.380 --> 01:57:10.980
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ngayon, ang sinasabi lang namin dito sa oversight function,

asr-002540
01:57:10.980 --> 01:57:12.600
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: hindi apektado dito.

asr-002541
01:57:12.600 --> 01:57:13.720
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Dito yung aplikante.

asr-002542
01:57:13.980 --> 01:57:15.620
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Once na-approve na yung application niya,

asr-002543
01:57:16.220 --> 01:57:17.500
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: hindi na namin yung binabawi.

asr-002544
01:57:17.660 --> 01:57:20.720
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Kahit may makita kami sa post-audit na may diferensya.

asr-002545
01:57:20.780 --> 01:57:24.000
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: We just call the attention of the concerned individuals

asr-002546
01:57:24.000 --> 01:57:26.840
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: and look at our policies.

asr-002547
01:57:26.980 --> 01:57:28.980
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Bakit nagkakaroon ng mga misunderstanding?

asr-002548
01:57:29.360 --> 01:57:32.100
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: We are trying to perfect the guidelines.

asr-002549
01:57:32.240 --> 01:57:36.160
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ayaw kasi namin ng walang basihan yung pag-approve and pag-disapprove

asr-002550
01:57:36.160 --> 01:57:38.300
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: or pag-issue ng mga notice of deficiencies.

asr-002551
01:57:38.300 --> 01:57:41.260
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: We want this to be very sustainable.

asr-002552
01:57:41.720 --> 01:57:42.520
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: By...

asr-002553
01:57:42.600 --> 01:57:44.600
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Incorporating all these gray areas.

asr-002554
01:57:44.760 --> 01:57:45.940
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Correcting these gray areas.

asr-002555
01:57:46.080 --> 01:57:47.640
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Pinapasok ngayon namin sa guidelines.

asr-002556
01:57:48.300 --> 01:57:51.220
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: And then, by end of the year, lalabas namin yung updated na

asr-002557
01:57:51.220 --> 01:57:55.180
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: parang general manual nung regulations natin.

asr-002558
01:57:55.700 --> 01:57:58.500
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So, I think we already addressed this problem.

asr-002559
01:57:58.640 --> 01:58:01.980
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Makikita naman sa data natin na 15 straight weeks.

asr-002560
01:58:02.280 --> 01:58:07.400
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Wala po tayong overdue pending regulatory application sa buong department.

asr-002561
01:58:07.400 --> 01:58:09.160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, after nyo nag-centralize,

asr-002562
01:58:09.640 --> 01:58:12.420
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ngayon, you're slowly going already?

asr-002563
01:58:12.600 --> 01:58:14.780
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Nag-decentralize.

asr-002564
01:58:14.780 --> 01:58:17.100
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: We are fully decentralized already.

asr-002565
01:58:17.260 --> 01:58:18.400
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: But, with oversight.

asr-002566
01:58:18.480 --> 01:58:19.080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: With oversight.

asr-002567
01:58:19.760 --> 01:58:21.280
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: To make sure na talagang, ano ito,

asr-002568
01:58:21.400 --> 01:58:23.420
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: yung mga licenses to sell are legit.

asr-002569
01:58:23.640 --> 01:58:24.380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yung lahat ng...

asr-002570
01:58:24.380 --> 01:58:26.060
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Tama ang pag-proseso.

asr-002571
01:58:26.160 --> 01:58:26.720
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: At mabilis.

asr-002572
01:58:26.780 --> 01:58:27.640
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Within 15 days.

asr-002573
01:58:28.880 --> 01:58:30.920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sa Center Bongo, you still have...

asr-002574
01:58:30.920 --> 01:58:34.320
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Naputo lang tayo.

asr-002575
01:58:38.320 --> 01:58:41.240
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Napansin ko po, napakali talaga ng...

asr-002576
01:58:41.240 --> 01:58:41.440
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Napakali talaga ng...

asr-002577
01:58:41.440 --> 01:58:42.440
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Napakali talaga ng...

asr-002578
01:58:42.600 --> 01:58:49.740
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kumbaga, sa budget ng buong national budget natin sa buong Pilipinas,

asr-002579
01:58:49.880 --> 01:58:54.400
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: napakaliit po talaga ng budget ng housing.

asr-002580
01:58:55.920 --> 01:59:00.420
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Pwede ba natin marinig from your end, Secretary Aliling?

asr-002581
01:59:00.860 --> 01:59:04.160
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: I mean, siyempre nag-uusap naman po kayo sa gabinete.

asr-002582
01:59:05.620 --> 01:59:09.560
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Hindi mo ba naipaglalaban na mabigyan ka ng...

asr-002583
01:59:09.560 --> 01:59:11.260
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kumbaga, ito yung cake, no?

asr-002584
01:59:11.260 --> 01:59:16.080
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So, hinahalimbawa ko po ito sa sports.

asr-002585
01:59:16.660 --> 01:59:19.500
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Usually, less than 1 billion lang yung budget nila.

asr-002586
01:59:20.280 --> 01:59:22.740
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Pero yung pag nananalo po ang ating atleta,

asr-002587
01:59:22.880 --> 01:59:28.400
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: napakalaking karangalan po na ibibigay sa ating bayan.

asr-002588
01:59:28.980 --> 01:59:31.120
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Eto naman pong problema sa housing.

asr-002589
01:59:31.660 --> 01:59:32.600
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Napakalaki po nito.

asr-002590
01:59:32.880 --> 01:59:34.360
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kawawa yung mga kababayan natin.

asr-002591
01:59:34.520 --> 01:59:38.520
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Hindi po, pantay-pantay talaga ang nangyayari.

asr-002592
01:59:38.520 --> 01:59:40.800
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ang daming mayayaman.

asr-002593
01:59:41.260 --> 01:59:43.800
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mas lalo pang yung mayayaman.

asr-002594
01:59:44.140 --> 01:59:45.160
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Marami pong may hirap.

asr-002595
01:59:45.980 --> 01:59:50.380
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Pero nananatiling mahirap at walang sariling bahay.

asr-002596
01:59:51.260 --> 01:59:56.380
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Until now, wala talaga silang sariling mauuwihan.

asr-002597
01:59:57.160 --> 02:00:00.160
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At in fact, sa kakaikot ko sa buong Pilipinas...

asr-002598
02:00:00.200 --> 02:00:22.660
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sa mga nasunugan, nabaha, nasa lanta ng bagyo, lindol, putok ng vulkan, napapansin ko na nandoon sila sa mga evacuation center na hindi sila komportable, walang mahigaan, rumi, nakakasakit yung mga bata.

asr-002599
02:00:22.660 --> 02:00:33.160
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Nag-file rin po ako, actually pumasa kanina sa sponsorship pa lang po ng aping chairman sa Committee on Housing na si Senator Cheese.

asr-002600
02:00:33.160 --> 02:00:52.600
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Itong Senate Bill 415, ito po yung rental housing subsidy. Ito po yung which seeks to provide rental assistance to informal settlers and families displaced by disasters as a way to help them transition into the formal housing market na sponsor na po ito kanina.

asr-002601
02:00:52.660 --> 02:01:10.920
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Para sa maraming pamilya, lalong-lalo na po sa mga informal settlers na nawala ng tahanan dahil sa kalamidad, mayroon silang agarang tulong kagad isang mas ligtas at disenting lugar na matitirahan habang unti-unti silang nakakabangon at makabalik sa kanilang mga pamamahay.

asr-002602
02:01:10.920 --> 02:01:20.260
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Tutulungan sila ng gobyerno o kalahating amount sa renta hanggang makabalik sila sa kanilang tirahan.

asr-002603
02:01:20.260 --> 02:01:40.280
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Pero ito yung sa mga tinatamaan ng disasters. Pero itong problema natin sa housing sa ngayon, kailan po kaya mangyayari yung panaginip o pangarap natin na sana naman wala ng squatter sa sariling bayan?

asr-002604
02:01:40.280 --> 02:01:49.500
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Dahil napansin ko napakaliit po talaga ng budget ng dishwood. Kumbaga sa cake, icing lang siguro wala po.

asr-002605
02:01:50.260 --> 02:01:51.460
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ano lang po?

asr-002606
02:01:51.500 --> 02:01:52.000
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Kandila.

asr-002607
02:01:54.660 --> 02:02:12.120
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Nakakalungkot po eh. Nakakalungkot sa totoo naman po. Sana po katulad ng ibang, nakakaingit yung ibang bansa. Makita mo yung mga housing sila. Ang lawak ng Pilipinas eh.

asr-002608
02:02:12.280 --> 02:02:19.380
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ito po Mr. Chairman, nakikita naman natin itong mga nakaraang taon, nakaraang mga buwan.

asr-002609
02:02:19.380 --> 02:02:45.540
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Umiikot si President Marcos sa mga housing sites natin. Kasama na rin dito yung pag-ikot niya sa mga informal settler areas. So makikita po natin dito na kailangan natin maging realistic. Number one yung affordability. Marami pa rin tayong mga kababayan na talaga hindi naman kaya pa bumili ng sariling tahanan.

asr-002610
02:02:45.860 --> 02:02:49.260
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Kaya nga po yung expanded 4PH natin.

asr-002611
02:02:49.380 --> 02:03:19.260
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Hindi nagdag natin dyan yung community mortgage program sa parental housing. Ito po eh para sa ating mga kababayan na eventually magkakaroon ng bahay pero hindi pa nila kaya. So yan po yung isa nating tinututukan ngayon. In fact, yan nga talaga yung priority dito sa inihingi namin dagdag budget is for the community mortgage program. Ngayon yung mga kaya pong bumili ng socialized housing. Dahil ito pong socialized housing, ginagawa po ito in partnership with the private sector.

asr-002612
02:03:19.380 --> 02:03:44.060
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Private sector developers. Tinignan po natin yung strength ng government sa private sector. Ang strength ng gobyerno rito pagdating po sa socialized housing segment ay yung pautang sa home buyer. Ang strength naman po ng private sector dito ay mag-produce o mag-develop ng mga socialized housing project para may bibilihin po yung mga mag-avail ng mga low interest rate ng pag-ibig.

asr-002613
02:03:44.060 --> 02:03:49.320
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: In fact, 3% lang po ang interest rate ngayon ng pag-ibig.

asr-002614
02:03:49.380 --> 02:04:01.600
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Sa socialized housing, pag bumili ang ating mga miyembro ng pag-ibig dito. So less than half po ito ng regular na interest na binibigay ng regular banks.

asr-002615
02:04:01.600 --> 02:04:18.100
