DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: ng bagyo, lindol, and other calamities.

asr-004007
02:49:52.180 --> 02:49:54.180
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Yung modular housing unit.

asr-004008
02:49:54.220 --> 02:49:57.280
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: And then, we also use this

asr-004009
02:49:57.280 --> 02:49:59.040
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: for repair of some

asr-004010
02:49:59.040 --> 02:50:00.600
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: socialized housing

asr-004011
02:50:00.600 --> 02:50:02.760
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: na nasisira din po ng mga bagyo

asr-004012
02:50:02.760 --> 02:50:03.920
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: and other calamities.

asr-004013
02:50:04.200 --> 02:50:05.480
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So, basically, yung po yung

asr-004014
02:50:05.480 --> 02:50:08.500
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: dun po natin ginagamit yung escrow fund.

asr-004015
02:50:09.600 --> 02:50:11.020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And that's good to know

asr-004016
02:50:11.020 --> 02:50:12.380
