asr-004030
02:50:36.080 --> 02:50:38.420
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: sa ilalim ng Department Order 2021

asr-004031
02:50:38.420 --> 02:50:40.380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: DAS 004

asr-004032
02:50:40.380 --> 02:50:41.920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ginawa lang na lang

