Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: this already a while ago

asr-004038
02:50:53.540 --> 02:50:54.200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: that there are

asr-004039
02:50:54.200 --> 02:50:55.920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: two DOJ opinions issued

asr-004040
02:50:55.920 --> 02:50:58.600
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: in 2024-2026

asr-004041
02:50:58.600 --> 02:51:00.320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: questioning the legality

asr-004042
02:51:00.320 --> 02:51:01.080
