asr-004046
02:51:07.760 --> 02:51:09.840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, what action has DSUD taken

asr-004047
02:51:09.840 --> 02:51:12.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: in response to these DOJ findings?

asr-004048
02:51:13.780 --> 02:51:15.460
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: The latest, Mr. Chairman,

asr-004049
02:51:15.600 --> 02:51:17.340
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: the latest DOJ opinion was

asr-004050
02:51:17.340 --> 02:51:21.840
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: we received it in February 2026.

asr-004051
02:51:22.620 --> 02:51:24.020
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So, once after we received it,

asr-004052
02:51:24.020 --> 02:51:25.460
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: we applied it prospectively.

asr-004053
02:51:25.960 --> 02:51:27.840
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So, sinunod namin yung DOJ opinion.

asr-004054
02:51:28.620 --> 02:51:32.740
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So, all future applications

asr-004055
02:51:32.740 --> 02:51:34.660
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: na mag-a-avail nitong escrow option,

asr-004056
02:51:35.160 --> 02:51:37.520
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: we already allowed,

asr-004057
02:51:37.520 --> 02:51:41.900
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: we already removed the 25% factor.

asr-004058
02:51:42.660 --> 02:51:43.880
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Then, ito rin po,

asr-004059
02:51:45.660 --> 02:51:47.760
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: ay na-issue ang kami ng COA

asr-004060
02:51:47.760 --> 02:51:50.400
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: sometime in April or May 2026

asr-004061
02:51:50.400 --> 02:51:53.980
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: saying na dapat i-apply namin yun retroactive.

asr-004062
02:51:54.020 --> 02:51:56.380
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So, knowing the impact

asr-004063
02:51:56.380 --> 02:51:57.980
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: of that application,

asr-004064
02:51:58.200 --> 02:51:59.360
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: the retroactive application

asr-004065
02:51:59.360 --> 02:52:00.360
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: sa mga cash flow

asr-004066
02:52:00.360 --> 02:52:01.280
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: ng mga developers,

asr-004067
02:52:02.040 --> 02:52:04.180
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: we requested for a moratorium

asr-004068
02:52:04.180 --> 02:52:05.360
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: sa Office of the President

asr-004069
02:52:05.360 --> 02:52:07.120
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: which we received,

asr-004070
02:52:07.280 --> 02:52:08.260
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: I think, last month,

asr-004071
02:52:08.720 --> 02:52:09.880
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: a little over last month,

asr-004072
02:52:10.400 --> 02:52:11.540
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: na inalaw yung

asr-004073
02:52:11.540 --> 02:52:14.340
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: suspension

asr-004074
02:52:14.340 --> 02:52:16.540
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: ng retroactive application.

asr-004075
02:52:17.560 --> 02:52:18.140
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ibig sabihin nito,

asr-004076
02:52:18.300 --> 02:52:19.480
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: yung assess and collection

asr-004077
02:52:19.480 --> 02:52:20.940
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: nung mga dapat collect tayo

asr-004078
02:52:20.940 --> 02:52:21.940
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: sa mga developers

asr-004079
02:52:21.940 --> 02:52:23.960
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: hanggang February 2026.

asr-004080
02:52:24.600 --> 02:52:25.140
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: 2027.

asr-004081
02:52:27.020 --> 02:52:29.320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, moratorium until 2027?

asr-004082
02:52:29.560 --> 02:52:29.720
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Yes.

asr-004083
02:52:30.600 --> 02:52:30.960
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: One year.

asr-004084
02:52:31.080 --> 02:52:32.020
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ang sabi po dun sa moratorium

asr-004085
02:52:32.640 --> 02:52:34.380
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: na approval ng Office of the President,

asr-004086
02:52:34.540 --> 02:52:36.320
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: one year from the issuance

asr-004087
02:52:36.320 --> 02:52:37.400
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: of the DOJ opinion

asr-004088
02:52:37.400 --> 02:52:38.540
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: which was issued

asr-004089
02:52:38.540 --> 02:52:40.200
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: February 2026.

asr-004090
02:52:40.440 --> 02:52:42.400
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So, February 2027 po,

asr-004091
02:52:42.780 --> 02:52:44.200
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: mag-e-expire yung moratorium.

asr-004092
02:52:44.640 --> 02:52:45.520
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: And at the same time,

asr-004093
02:52:46.100 --> 02:52:48.040
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: we received also communications

asr-004094
02:52:48.040 --> 02:52:50.020
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: from the urban poor community.

asr-004095
02:52:51.720 --> 02:52:52.180
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Of course,

asr-004096
02:52:52.600 --> 02:52:53.480
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: alam naman natin

asr-004097
02:52:53.480 --> 02:53:13.980
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Ang output nitong escrow fund at the end of the day are all related to socialized housing. So ang magiging beneficiary nito, nakakaraming beneficiary nito ay yung nasa urban housing sector. So we are communicating with both the developers and the urban poor sector.

asr-004098
02:53:13.980 --> 02:53:29.980
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: In fact, last week, we had a meeting with the private sector advisory council for real estate with the president. So we discussed on how to deal with this DOJ and COA issue, including the moratorium, Mr. Chair.

asr-004099
02:53:30.460 --> 02:53:36.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Okay, thank you. Ito pa, just two more points. Ito sa ano pa rin ito?

asr-004100
02:53:38.460 --> 02:53:43.660
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Developers express their concern that projects dating from as early as 2017 will be collected escrow.

asr-004101
02:53:43.980 --> 02:53:48.140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Deficiency, even if they complied in good faith with the prevailing rules at the time.

asr-004102
02:53:48.900 --> 02:53:53.360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: These developers followed rules issued by the government and obtained approvals from the government.

asr-004103
02:53:53.940 --> 02:54:01.840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: If the issue itself issued a legally defective rule, is it fair to make the private sector shoulder the entire consequence years later?

asr-004104
02:54:02.540 --> 02:54:08.840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So how does the issue intend to address this concern and ensure the fair implementation of the revised requirements?

asr-004105
02:54:09.580 --> 02:54:12.520
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Again, as I mentioned a while ago,

asr-004106
02:54:13.260 --> 02:54:13.660
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: we

asr-004107
02:54:13.660 --> 02:54:16.060
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: knowing the effect of this

asr-004108
02:54:16.060 --> 02:54:24.400
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: retroactive application to the cash flow of developers, we requested for a moratorium, which was approved by the office of the president.

asr-004109
02:54:24.400 --> 02:54:34.880
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: And then at the same time, we are also discussing with the urban poor on how to have a good way of proceeding with this matter, Mr. Chair.

asr-004110
02:54:34.980 --> 02:54:39.280
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: And in fact, the office of the president is already on top of this matter.

asr-004111
02:54:41.780 --> 02:54:42.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Okay, thank you.

asr-004112
02:54:42.740 --> 02:54:42.860
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Thank you.

asr-004113
02:54:43.660 --> 02:54:52.060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ito naman sa housing programs for last point, housing programs for middle-income Filipinos under Republic Act No. 11201,

asr-004114
02:54:52.100 --> 02:54:57.960
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: the issue is mandated to develop a national strategy to provide adequate affordable housing to all Filipinos.

asr-004115
02:54:58.440 --> 02:55:02.480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: While we recognize the importance of socialized housing for underprivileged families,

